  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Mullin described AI as a \"game changer\" and a \"force multiplier.\" In June 2026, he said that when looking at the biggest threats from AI, the use is through financial gain. In a July 2026 statement, he said a strategic partnership would promote advancements in artificial intelligence and explore how technologies can enhance defenses while driving innovation and competitiveness.",
   "sids": [
    "s2",
    "s1",
    "s5",
    "s4"
   ],
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Mullin described AI as a \"game changer\" and a \"force multiplier.\"",
     "sids": [
      "s2"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "In June 2026, he said that when looking at the biggest threats from AI, the use is through financial gain.",
     "sids": [
      "s1",
      "s5"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "In a July 2026 statement, he said a strategic partnership would promote advancements in artificial intelligence and explore how technologies can enhance defenses while driving innovation and competitiveness.",
